Eclipse:

REQUIREMENTS:
- JDK
- Python

for windows run:
winget install Microsoft.OpenJDK.21
winget install Python.Python.3.12
then run the app from Eclypse folder using run.bat

for macOS run:
brew install openjdk@21
brew install python@3.12
then run the app from Eclypse folder using ./run.sh

for Linux run:
sudo apt update
sudo apt install openjdk-21-jdk python3 python3-venv python3-pip
then run the app from Eclypse folder using ./run.sh

